urkey, Bhupender Yadav, the Union environment minister, articulated India's dedication to climate change initiatives. He shared insights on India’s substantial advancements in solar power and renewable energy. Emphasising equity and climate justice, he voiced regret over the failure to achieve consensus on the cover decision. India’s proactive engagement with other nations showcases its resolve to address climate issues through collaboration.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/absence-of-cop31-cover-decision-does-not-pause-climate-action-in-india-says-bhupender-yadav/articleshow/136079143.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/absence-of-cop31-cover-decision-does-not-pause-climate-action-in-india-says-bhupender-yadav/articleshow/136079143.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-22T22:29:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vishwa Mohan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136079652,imgsize-104034.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[COP31 ends without climate pact as countries fail to reach consensus over fossil fuel omission and empty finance promises]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cop31-ends-without-climate-pact-as-countries-fail-to-reach-consensus-over-fossil-fuel-omission-and-empty-finance-promises/articleshow/136079511.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136079511.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cop31-ends-without-climate-pact-as-countries-fail-to-reach-consensus-over-fossil-fuel-omission-and-empty-finance-promises/articleshow/136079511.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cop31-ends-without-climate-pact-as-countries-fail-to-reach-consensus-over-fossil-fuel-omission-and-empt